.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority",{"_95":131},"platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority.mdx",{"_70":133,"_77":88,"_72":134,"_82":135,"_91":-7,"_12":136,"_93":137},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx","Emite y verifica un certificado","Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate",{"_95":138},"platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx",{"_70":140,"_77":116,"_91":-7,"_72":141},"es:_1","Conceptos",{"_70":143,"_77":88,"_72":144,"_82":145,"_91":-7,"_12":146,"_93":147},"es:platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx","Modelo de confianza","Entiende dónde nace la confianza, cómo se distribuye y qué valida cada componente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model",{"_95":148},"platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx",{"_70":150,"_77":88,"_72":151,"_82":152,"_91":-7,"_12":153,"_93":154},"es:platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_95":155},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_70":157,"_77":116,"_91":-7,"_72":158},"es:_2","Claves, autoridades y certificados",{"_70":160,"_77":88,"_72":161,"_82":162,"_91":-7,"_12":163,"_93":164},"es:platform/pki/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_95":165},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_70":167,"_77":88,"_72":168,"_82":169,"_91":-7,"_12":170,"_93":171},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_95":172},"platfo